{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43495","headline":"听霜钟 · 无名氏","name":"听霜钟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寥亮来丰岭，分明辨古钟。\n应霜如自击，中节每相从。\n静听非闲扣，潜应蕴圣踪。\n风间时断续，云外更舂容。\n虚警和清籁，雄鸣隔乱峰。\n因之论知己，感激更难逢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43495.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43495","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}